<title>USA: SMC names Jay Howard president/COO.</title>
<headline>SMC names Jay Howard president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>HARRISBURG, Ore. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>SMC Corp said Wednesday that it has promoted Jay Howard to the position of president and chief operating officer, succeeding Mathew Perlot, who continues as chief executive officer and chairman of the board of directors.</p>
<p>Howard, who was previously executive vice president of the company, joined SMC as vice president-manufacturing in 1995.</p>
